From: Carlos Cabrera H. <6750732+ccabrerah@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 22] ggml-sycl: one-token decode kernels for 1-4 tokens (the MTP verify step)

mmvw (bf16/f16 wide matvec) templated on 1-4 columns, each weight row read once; the fused q2_0 MoE gate+up+SwiGLU
with a token dimension; smallk with a batch dimension. A T-token call gives the same bits as T one-token calls
(apply_mmvw_nt_v17.py, apply_moe_glu_nt.py, apply_smallk_batch.py in the research scripts).

